  "role": "Heavy striker",
  "summary": "A fast heavy with broad shoulder mounts and carefully balanced cooling. It reaches the firing line before most heavy opponents.",
  "lore": "Recovered Halberds stood in their depot without weapons. Sarn fitted cradles to the surviving shoulder interfaces and hung local racks where certified replacements were missing. Later service restored advanced emitters and carefully balanced cooling without always removing those practical additions. Tall shoulder pylons identify the fast heavy at a distance. Its cooling surfaces can be serviced, but precise work takes time and replacement Aurelian components remain scarce. A polished Halberd may carry a thoroughly mixed repair history.",
